<!-- SEOAI:QACONTENT:START --><script type="application/ld+json">{"@type":"FAQPage","@context":"https://schema.org","mainEntity":[{"name":"When should we build custom vs buy off-the-shelf?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Build custom when your process is a competitive advantage, when off-the-shelf tools require significant workarounds, or when integration requirements are complex. Buy when there's a strong market fit and customization needs are minimal. We help clients make this decision honestly—sometimes we recommend against custom builds.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"How do you ensure the software gets adopted by teams?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"We involve end users from day one—not just managers. Regular demos, feedback sessions, and iterative refinement based on actual usage. Software that reflects how people actually work gets used; software designed in isolation gets ignored.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"What happens if our requirements change mid-project?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"We expect requirements to evolve—that's why we work iteratively. Every 2-week cycle delivers working software and an opportunity to adjust direction. Major scope changes require trade-off conversations, but the process is designed for flexibility, not rigidity.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"How do you handle integration with legacy systems?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"We build integration layers that connect to existing systems via APIs, database connections, or file exchanges. Legacy systems often outlive their expected lifespans—our approach ensures new software works alongside old without requiring risky full migrations.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"What's the total cost of ownership for custom software?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Initial build is typically 3-6 months of development. Ongoing costs include hosting (often $500-2000/month), maintenance (10-20% of build cost annually), and enhancements as needed. We provide detailed TCO projections before project start so you can compare against alternatives.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Can Zunkiree Labs deliver custom software work regardless of where my team is located?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Yes. We deliver custom software projects globally, including for clients across the US, UK, India, Australia, Canada, Switzerland, and the Netherlands, using the same agile process and milestone reporting regardless of location, with time-zone overlap built into every engagement.","@type":"Answer"}}]}</script><!-- SEOAI:QACONTENT:END -->
